pan style=\" color: black; \">PDAC, colloid</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\" color: black; \">&minus;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 109.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"146\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\" color: black; \">+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.7pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\" color: black; \">+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 90.75pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"121\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\" color: black; \">+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 120.5pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"161\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\" color: black; \">&minus;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">HG-PanIN, high-grade pancreatic intraepithelial neoplasia; IPMN, intraductal papillary mucinous neoplasm; IPNB, intraductal papillary neoplasm of the bile duct; LG-PanIN, low-grade pancreatic intraepithelial neoplasia; PDAC, pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma.</p>",
